It is evening and I am finished with work.
I am walking home.
I am very hungry.
I see a snack stand.
A man is working in the snack stand.
"Good evening, what can I get you?" the man asks.
"A Currywurst, please," I answer.
"With fries?" he asks.
"Yes, please," I say.
The food costs five euros.
I pay the five euros and take the Currywurst.
It is January and it is cold.
I stand on the street and eat.
The food is warm and tastes good.
I now have a flat and a German mobile phone.
I work in Berlin.
I look at the street.
I am really in Germany.
I live here now.
